        <activityName xml:lang="en">Residual material landfill facility</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Residual material landfill facility
inorganic landfill for polluted inorganic wastes like with carbon content below 5%.  300'000 m3 volume. Construction phase is 5 years;
UUID: 0311b8c7-c4b4-3863-baee-04ee9d28c324
infrastructure materials for landfill construction, operation and aftercare. Including access road.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss residual material landfill for polluted, inorganic waste. With base seal and leachate collection system. Recultivation and monitoring for 40 years after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source on sanitary landfill, adapted to features of this landfill type 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0311b8c7-c4b4-3863-baee-04ee9d28c324.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
